   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "presence",
   "originalText": "presence",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "tld2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 690,
   "width": 310,
   "height": 41,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100051,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700357,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "key present = active, key gone = invisible.\nNo heartbeats, no presence service, no\nonline/offline events to order and reconcile.",
   "originalText": "key present = active, key gone = invisible.\nNo heartbeats, no presence service, no\nonline/offline events to order and reconcile.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1n",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 744,
   "width": 413,
   "height": 82,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100052,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700364,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why a cache and not a database: the data is worthless in 30\nseconds and self-correcting - the next update overwrites it\nregardless of what happened to the last. There is nothing\nfor durability to protect. Paying for replication, WAL\nwrites and failover on data with a 30-second half-life\nwould be spending the wallet's budget on a weather forecast.",
   "originalText": "Why a cache and not a database: the data is worthless in 30\nseconds and self-correcting - the next update overwrites it\nregardless of what happened to the last. There is nothing\nfor durability to protect. Paying for replication, WAL\nwrites and failover on data with a 30-second half-life\nwould be spending the wallet's budget on a weather forecast.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1f",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 856,
   "width": 413,
   "height": 110,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100053,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700371,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And float32 is FINE here, unlike prices or money. ~7\nsignificant digits puts latitude within ~1 metre - far below\nconsumer GPS accuracy (3-10 m open, much worse in cities).\nThe MEASUREMENT error dwarfs the representation error, so\nthe precision loss is unobservable. Money has no measurement\nerror, so representation error is the only error there is -\nwhich is why 'never use floats' is a rule about money, not\nabout numbers.",
   "originalText": "And float32 is FINE here, unlike prices or money. ~7\nsignificant digits puts latitude within ~1 metre - far below\nconsumer GPS accuracy (3-10 m open, much worse in cities).\nThe MEASUREMENT error dwarfs the representation error, so\nthe precision loss is unobservable. Money has no measurement\nerror, so representation error is the only error there is -\nwhich is why 'never use floats' is a rule about money, not\nabout numbers.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1x",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1004,
   "width": 426,
   "height": 41,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100054,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700378,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No spatial index: positions are looked up by user_id, never by\nproximity. Sharded on user_id by consistent hashing, so the\ninit MGET fans out across shards in parallel.",
   "originalText": "No spatial index: positions are looked up by user_id, never by\nproximity. Sharded on user_id by consistent hashing, so the\ninit MGET fans out across shards in parallel.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
