   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "gn0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1748,
   "width": 552,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100101,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700707,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "privacy leaks at the SUBSCRIPTION boundary, not the display boundary",
   "originalText": "privacy leaks at the SUBSCRIPTION boundary, not the display boundary",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "gd0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1770,
   "width": 911,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100102,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700714,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a server subscribes to a friend's channel and THEN filters by distance, so it receives that friend's exact position even\nwhen they are 500 miles away and should be invisible. Nothing reaches the user, but the data crossed a process boundary it\ndid not need to. Geohash-prefixed channels would fix this structurally - a stronger argument than the efficiency case.",
   "originalText": "a server subscribes to a friend's channel and THEN filters by distance, so it receives that friend's exact position even\nwhen they are 500 miles away and should be invisible. Nothing reaches the user, but the data crossed a process boundary it\ndid not need to. Geohash-prefixed channels would fix this structurally - a stronger argument than the efficiency case.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
