   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "both rows must be written together, and a partial write leaves an ASYMMETRIC friendship where A sees B but not vice versa -\nwhich shows up as a confusing one-way visibility bug rather than an error. A periodic symmetry check belongs here.",
